sequenceDiagram
%% config
autonumber
participant controller as controller : GameController
participant computer as computer : ComputerPlayer
participant strategy as strategy : WinningThenRandomStrategy
participant game as game : GomokuGame
participant board as board : Board
participant history as history : MoveHistory
participant ui as ui : ConsoleUI

%% notes
%% action needed
Note over controller: Incomplete - GameController is not implemented and would coordinate the turn.
Note over history: Incomplete - MoveHistory is not implemented.
Note over ui: Incomplete - ConsoleUI and its display methods are not implemented.
Note over game,strategy: Incomplete - GetValidMoves creates Move objects with computer's reusable MarkPiece.
Note over board: Typed Piece cells and public dimensions are TBC.


%% keep
Note over game,board: Computer is Player 2 and a legal O move completes five in a row.
Note over computer: The MarkPiece is reusable and remains available.
Note over game: Result = PLAYER_TWO_WIN and IsGameOver = true. No player switch follows a win.

%% steps
controller->>computer: ChooseMove(game)
computer->>strategy: ChooseMove(game, computer)
strategy->>game: GetCurrentPlayer()
game-->>strategy: computer
strategy->>game: GetValidMoves()
game-->>strategy: validMoves

loop Each candidate until an immediate winning move is found
    strategy->>game: WouldMoveWin(candidate)
    game->>game: IsValidMove(candidate)
    game->>game: HasWinningLine(row, column, O)
    game-->>strategy: true or false
end

strategy-->>computer: winningMove
computer-->>controller: winningMove

controller->>game: MakeMove(winningMove)
game->>game: IsValidMove(winningMove)
game->>computer: UsePiece(winningMove.Piece)
computer-->>game: true


game->>game: ApplyMove(winningMove)
game->>board: PlaceMove(winningMove)
board-->>game: placed
game->>history: AddMove(winningMove)
history-->>game: recorded
game->>game: EvaluateResult()
game->>board: GetCell(row, column)
board-->>game: computer's MarkPiece
game->>game: HasWinningLine(row, column, O)
game->>game: GetWinResult(O)
game-->>controller: true

%% NEED TO CONFIRM THIS STEP
controller->>ui: display final board and result (TBC)